        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b> First Impressions 1015 Large Decorative Scroll Door Knob</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThese ornate scroll pattern large decorative knobs are designed as dummies only. They are used as doors pulls or door decorations. They are also used on large Furniture, such as Amoures and Cabinets.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThis style door knob pull were made popular on larger European homes often placed in the doors center. Cast in solid brass and assembled in the USA by the expert craftsmen at First Impressions International, famous for high quality innovational door pull designs.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for First Impressions 1015 Large  Decorative Scroll Pattern Door Knob\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Rosette Diameter: 3.5\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>Packaged Standard with Thrubolt mounting (Bolts thru the door). Optional Surface mounting or Back to Back mounting available (Pulls bolt to each other - Requires 2 door pulls).\r\n</p>",
